ven-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Gerweck</surname><given-names>LE</given-names></name><name><surname>Goitein</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Loeffler</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Suit</surname><given-names>HD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Relative biological effectiveness (RBE) values for proton beam radiotherapy</article-title><source>Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys</source><year>2002</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>407</fpage><lpage>421</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys||53|407||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12023146</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pai</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name><name><surname>Thornton</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Katznelson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hypothalamic&#x0002f;pituitary function following high-dose conformal radiotherapy to the base of skull: demonstration of a dose&#x02013;effect relationship using dose&#x02013;volume histogram analysis</article-title><source>Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys</source><year>2001</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>1079</fpage><lpage>1092</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys||49|1079||bib18|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11240250</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pollack</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Zagars</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Preliminary results of a randomized radiotherapy dose-escalation study comparing 70&#x02009;Gy with 78&#x02009;Gy for prostate cancer</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>2000</year><volume>18</v